    <string name="setup_title">Chechen keyboard</string>
    <string name="setup_intro">Write Chechen in Latin and Cyrillic script — a LinguaCE project.\n\n• 🌐: switch between Latin and Cyrillic.\n• Hold a letter for its variants (x → ẋ, s → ş, ç → ç̇…).\n• In Cyrillic, the Ӏ key (palochka).\n• Type without accents: “noxciyn” suggests “noxçiyŋ”.</string>
